@.str.574 = private unnamed_addr constant [352 x i8] c"Set the framework's log level. The log level defines the verbosity of the testing logs produced by a test module. The verbosity ranges from a complete log, when all assertions (both successful and failing) are reported, all notifications about test units start and finish are included, to an empty log when nothing is reported to a testing log stream.\00", align 1
